    "preamble": "Muvva Sandeep Kumar vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 26 February, 2020 Author: J. Uma Devi Bench: J.Uma Devi The Hon'Ble Ms.JUSTICE J.Uma Devi Criminal Petition No.6670 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed by the petitioners/ A-1 and A- 2, seeking to quash the proceedings in Crime No.366 of 2019 of SHO, Pattabhipuram Police Station, Guntur District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 272, 273, 188 and 328 r/w 34 I.P.C and Sections 58, 59 and 63 of Food Standards and Safety Act, 2006. The case on hand has also been filed questioning the proceedings in Crime No.366 of 2019 of SHO, Pattabhipuram Police Station, Guntur District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 272, 273, 188 and 328 r/w 34 I.P.C and Sections 58, 59 and 63 of Food Standards and Safety Act, 2006.",
